OL,3,AUK economy grew 0.1% in August ahead of
OL,4,AHealey's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's economy grew slightly in
OL,7,FAugust, according to the last set of
OL,8,Fofficial figures before John Healey's
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FWith the chancellor planning to set out
OL,12,Fhis tax and spending plans later this
OL,13,Fmonth, the Office for National
OL,14,FStatistics (ONS) said the economy
OL,15,Fexpanded by 0.1%, which was better than
OL,16,Fanalysts had expected.
OL,18,FThe small increase follows growth of
OL,19,F0.4% in July, as well as positive
OL,20,Fupgrades to the outlook for Britain's
OL,21,Feconomy from global watchdog the
OL,22,FInternational Monetary Fund (IMF).
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
